<title>MACEDONIA: Macedonia to assemble Audi A3 - source.</title>
<headline>Macedonia to assemble Audi A3 - source.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Macedonian government and German car producer Audi are to sign a memorandum covering the assembly of the Audi A3 car, an official of Macedonia's Asiba company said.</p>
<p>Peco Dimovski, a director of ASIBA which is an importer of Audi cars, told Reuters on Wednesday that assembly would start next March. The exact number of cars involved was still to be negotiated.</p>
<p>A factory worth 86 million marks was to be constructed and Audi itself will invest 60 percent of the value, he said.</p>
<p>-- Mircela Casule, Skopje newsroom ++389 91 201 196</p>
